Z||000000||Mach10||09-30-2001||07:50 PM||||Does anyone subscribe to this service? I have a few articles that I'd like to view, but can't as yet justify the annual cost. (That and I am BROKE)... I don't need access, just some info about the following articles:<P>ATRATB8816 MAR 88 No Upshift - Governor Contamination <P>ATRATB8730 MAY 87 No Upshift <P>ATRATB873 JAN 87 Harsh 1-2 Shift When Hot/Medium Acceleration <P>ATRATB8645 SEP 86 Band Adjustment - Intermediate <P>86723 JUN 86 1986 THM 125C Harsh 1-2 Upshift When Hot During Medium to Hard<P>86718 APR 86 All THM Transmission/Transaxle Assemblies Control Valve Assembl<P>ATRATB8616 APR 86 Late Or No Upshift On Check Ball Type Governor <BR> <BR>ATRASIL8631 DEC 86 Control Valve Assembly Cleaning/Servicing <P>88732 MAY 88 Hard or No Shift Caused By Loose Shift Lever Nut 1986-1/2 - 198 <P>ATRATB8923 AUG 89 Automatic Transmission Math Formulas <P>90SM3 FEB 90 Driveability Worksheet <P>ATRATB010 SEP 90 Torque Converter Identification <P>ATRATB078 NOV 91 How To Use A Pressure Gauge - Automatic Trans. <P>PM me if you know of a source for these articles, please!<P>Thanks!<P>||||reg||5
Z||000001||isthiswhereiputausername?||09-30-2001||08:02 PM||||I dont suscribe to the service, but I do have a mechanic neighbor who has bought all the alldata cd collection (51 CDS), the Mitchell on demand collection (15cds) and the mitchell tranny cds (4cds) (I can copy the articles for you.. Heres the first one, PM me your email address and I will send them directly to you (save using up Cliffs space, unless someone else wants them too?) <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ATRATB8816.jpg">  <P>Heres what is on each one:<P>Yellow Discs (3 CDs) "Service Writer Assistant"<P>Disc 01) All Makes 1982-1991 - Parts & Labor, TSB Titles, Maintenance Schedules<BR>Disc 02) All Makes 1992-1996 - Parts & Labor, TSB Titles, Maintenance Schedules<BR>Disc 03) All Makes 1997-2000 - Parts & Labor, TSB Titles, Maintenance Schedules<P>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<P>Red Discs (14 CDs)<P>Asian Import Vehicles<P>Cars:<P>Disc 01) Acura 1986-2000 / Daihatsu 1986-2000<BR>Disc 02) Honda 1982-2000 / Hyundai 1986-1990<BR>Disc 03) Hyundai 1991-2000 / Infiniti 1982-2000 / Isuzu 1982-2000<BR>Disc 04) Kia 1990-2000 / Lexus 1990-2000<BR>Disc 05) Mazda 1982-2000<BR>Disc 06) Mitsubishi 1983-2000<BR>Disc 07) Nissan 1982-2000<BR>DIsc 08) Subaru & Suzuki 1982-2000 / Toyota 1982-1993<BR>Disc 09) Toyota 1994-2000<P>Trucks:<P>Disc 10) Trucks - Acura, Daihatsu, Honda, Hyundai, Infiniti 1986-2000<BR>Disc 11) Trucks - Isuzu 1982-2000<BR>DISC 12) Trucks - Kia, Lexus, Mazda 1982-2000<BR>Disc 13) Trucks - Mitsubishi, Nissan, Subaru 1982-2000<BR>Disc 14) Trucks - Suzuki, Toyota 1982-2000<P>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<P>Purple Discs (6 CDs)<P>European Import Vehicles<P>Disc 01) 1982-2000 Audi / 1982-1995 BMW<BR>Disc 02) 1996-2000 BMW / Jaguar, Land Rover 1982-2000<BR>Disc 03) 1982-1993 Mercedes Benz<BR>Disc 04) 1994-2000 Mercedes Benz / 1982-2000 Peugeot<BR>Disc 05) 1982-2000 Porsche, Renault, Saab<BR>Disc 06) 1982-2000 Volkswagen, Volvo, Yugo<P>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<P>Grey Discs (7 CDs)<P>Domestic Vehicles<P>Coverage: Ford, Lincoln, Mercury<P>Disc 01) 1982-1989 Ford, Lincoln, Mercury<BR>Disc 02) 1990-1992 Ford, Lincoln, Mercury<BR>Disc 03) 1993-1994 Ford, Lincoln, Mercury<BR>Disc 04) 1995-1996 Ford, Lincoln, Mercury<BR>Disc 05) 1997 Ford, Lincoln, Mercury<BR>Disc 06) 1998 Ford, Lincoln, Mercury<BR>Disc 07) 1999-2000 Ford, Lincoln, Mercury<P>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<P>Blue Discs (14 CDs)<P>Domestic Vehicles<P>Coverage: General Motors - Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Geo, GMC, Oldsmobile, Pontiac, Saturn<P>Disc 01) 1982-1986 Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, GMC, Oldsmobile, Pontiac<BR>Disc 02) 1987-1989 Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Geo, GMC, Oldsmobile, Pontiac<BR>Disc 03) 1990-1991 Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Geo, GMC, Oldsmobile, Pontiac, Saturn<BR>Disc 04) 1992  Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Geo, GMC, Oldsmobile, Pontiac, Saturn<BR>Disc 05) 1993 Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Geo, GMC, Oldsmobile, Pontiac, Saturn<BR>Disc 06) 1994 Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Geo, GMC, Oldsmobile, Pontiac, Saturn<BR>Disc 07) 1995 Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Geo, GMC, Oldsmobile, Pontiac, Saturn<BR>Disc 08) 1996 Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Geo, GMC, Oldsmobile, Pontiac, Saturn<BR>Disc 09) 1997A Buick, Chevrolet, Oldsmobile, Pontiac<BR>Disc 10) 1997B Cadillac, Geo, Saturn / ALL GM Trucks<BR>Disc 11) 1998A Buick, Chevrolet, Oldsmobile, Pontiac<BR>Disc 12) 1998B Cadillac, Saturn / ALL GM Trucks<BR>Disc 13) 1999A Buick, Chevrolet, Oldmobile, Pontiac<BR>Disc 14) 1999B-2000 Cadillac, Saturn / ALL GM Trucks / All 2000 vEHICLES<P>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<P>Green Discs (6 CDs)<P>Domestic Vehicles<P>Coverage: Chrysler, Dodge, Eagle, Jeep, Plymouth<P>Disc 01) 1982-1990 Chrysler, Dodge, Eagle, Jeep, Plymouth<BR>Disc 02) 1991-1993 Chrysler, Dodge, Eagle, Jeep, Plymouth<BR>Disc 03) 1994-1995 Chrysler, Dodge, Eagle, Jeep, Plymouth<BR>Disc 04) 1996-1997 Chrysler, Dodge, Eagle, Jeep, Plymouth<BR>Disc 05) 1998  Chrysler, Dodge, Eagle, Jeep, Plymouth<BR>Disc 06) 1999-2000 Chrysler, Dodge, Jeep, Plymouth<BR><p>[This message has been edited by isthiswhereiputausername? (edited 09-30-2001).]||||reg||1
